    "created_at": "2023-02-09T16:24:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-09T16:24:54Z",
    "body": "That would be okay as long as those steps are not allowed to execute script. If they are allowed to execute script (e.g., dispatch events) we'd need something closer to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#update-the-rendering as at that point ordering becomes important. (I suppose ordering could still be important if APIs have interdependencies but they could define a shared set of steps in such a case.)\r\n\r\nI'm guessing we don't want to allow more script opportunities so your suggestion is probably fine, but I don't have the full picture.",
